{
 "schema": 1,
 "id": "rom",
 "title": {
  "zh": "活动范围：rom.json vs 两个模型的关节限位",
  "en": "Range of motion: rom.json vs the joint limits of the two models"
 },
 "method": {
  "zh": "逐个条目、逐个方向，把 data/curated/rig/rom.json 的数与参照坐标的上下限并排（都自解剖学零位起算）。参照坐标的正方向由 MuJoCo 里一块主动肌是否缩短核对过。",
  "en": "Entry by entry and direction by direction, the number in data/curated/rig/rom.json beside the limit of the reference coordinate (both from the anatomical zero). The positive direction of each reference coordinate was checked by whether an agonist shortens in MuJoCo."
 },
 "tolerance": {
  "zh": "相差超过 10° 记为 outside（任务给定）。注意：模型的关节限位是为仿真设的，不是测得的正常活动范围；rom.json 里 sourced 的条目有测量来源，出现分歧时应先信 rom.json。",
  "en": "A difference above 10° is \"outside\" (as specified for this task). Note that a model's joint limits are set for simulation and are not measured normal ranges; where they disagree with a `sourced` entry of rom.json, rom.json has the measurement behind it."
 },
