 "notes": [
  {
   "zh": "没有比的条目：骨盆朝向、髌骨、膝旋转、胸锁/肩锁关节（MyoArm 里它们是肩抬高的从动关节，没有独立范围）、拇指腕掌关节（两个模型的轴定义不同）、足趾趾间关节、颞下颌关节、颈椎和胸椎各节、肋骨：两个参照里没有对应的独立坐标。",
   "en": "Entries not compared: pelvis orientation, patella, knee rotation, sternoclavicular and acromioclavicular joints (dependent on shoulder elevation in MyoArm, with no range of their own), thumb carpometacarpal joint (the axes are defined differently), toe interphalangeal joints, temporomandibular joint, cervical and thoracic levels, ribs: neither reference has a matching independent coordinate."
